 "words_heard": 235,
 "words": 248,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He crossed the border with six hundred men",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To Achish son of Maoch, king of Gath",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "David asked for favor in the eyes",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A place in one of the outlying towns",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Why live in the royal city with you?",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your servant asks for a small place to stay",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That day Achish gave him Ziklag",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ziklag belongs to the kings of Judah",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A year and four months in Philistine land",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Living in the shadow of a foreign crown",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "David and his men went up to raid",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Geshurites, the Girzites, Amalekites",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They took sheep, cattle, donkeys, camels",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No man or woman left alive behind",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He returned to Achish with the spoils",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying he raided the Negev of Judah",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That day Achish gave him Ziklag",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ziklag belongs to the kings of Judah",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A year and four months in Philistine land",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Living in the shadow of a foreign crown",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Achish trusted him, thinking he was detestable",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Made himself utterly loathsome to Israel",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He thought David would be his servant for life",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Deceiving the king with every report",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "David left no one to report his deeds",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Such was his practice the whole time he lived",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the territory of the son of Maacah",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hiding his true path from the eyes of Gath",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That day Achish gave him Ziklag",
